# Loaded by `vite --mode mock` (`npm run frontend:mock` from the repo root).
# Every API call is answered by src/api/mockApi.js, including real-looking numbers, so no backend
# or keys are needed. Test details (9000000xxx, DEMO- venue IDs) use the demo backend in every
# build anyway; this mode is only for trying other numbers offline. Never set it for a deployment.
VITE_USE_MOCK_API=true
